  "id": "religiousness",
  "term": "religiousness",
  "definition": "Religiousness is a spirituality-related aspect of a person’s life that is considered relevant to how people report their quality of life and health. In psychology, it is discussed as part of coping and well-being, alongside factors such as faith, positive attitude, and inner peace that may relate to lower stress and depression.",
